# Local data (file-based storage in v1 — see docs/decisions.md D4)
# NOTE 2026-08-11 (Olly): `data/` and `examples/real/` were un-ignored so a CLOUD session can
# see the real site inputs — a cloud environment clones from origin and cannot otherwise run
# the Grundon/Harwell validations at all. This reverses the earlier never-commit policy on a
# PRIVATE repo, deliberately. Git history is permanent: treat everything under those paths as
# customer-confidential, and do not make this repository public without rewriting history.
*.parquet

# Real customer intake data (HH series, site facts, invoices) — now TRACKED, see the note
# above. Still customer-confidential; never edit the source workbooks, re-derive instead.

# Quote-run artifacts written by `gridq run` (file-based; reproducible from inputs).
runs/
# WP-GRC-05: the IC-4 evidence registry (executed DPAs). Never committed.
evidence/
# WP-OPS-01: the owner-side candidate site dossier and its register (customer facts). Never
# committed; `python -m gridq.ops.dossier` refuses to write a real-site dossier elsewhere.
dossiers/

